    "created_at": "2019-09-03T09:45:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-03T09:45:42Z",
    "body": "Is this the right place to subscribe for the ability to change the colour of each section of the prompt?\r\n\r\nIdeally I'm interested in true colour support. In ZSH it works like this:\r\n\r\n```zsh\r\n# @args: red, gree, blue, string\r\n# In ZSH everything inside %{ ... %} has zero width\r\nfunction print_true_rgb() {\r\n  fg_open=\"%{\\033[38;2;\"\r\n  bg_open=\"%{\\033[48;2;\"\r\n  close=\"m%}$4%{\\033[0m%}\"\r\n  print \"$fg_open$1;$2;$3$close\"\r\n}\r\n```",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
